Title: The Open: Welcome to Portrush
Date: 2025-07-14
Firsthand information: {'Speaker': [], 'Description': [{'Description': 'The best golfers in the world have descended on the Northern Irish town of Portrush for the 153rd Open Championship.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 1, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 89}}, {'Description': "This page will be your dedicated resource for everything from the Open Championship as BBC Sport takes you through every twist and turn in the crowning of 2025's 'Champion Golfer of the Year'.", 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 3, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 177}}, {'Description': "Alongside our live radio and text coverage throughout the week, we'll aim to bring you some of the press conferences from the likes of Rory McIlroy and defending champion Xander Schauffele alongside expert analysis from our golf correspondent Iain Carter and reporters on the course.", 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 4, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 242}}, {'Description': "Just hit the 'follow' button on website or app to add it to your 'MySport' feed.", 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 5, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 75}}], 'Image': [{'ID': 'image_1', 'Caption': 'The Open Championship at Royal Portrush'}]}
